{"ordinal":14585,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452396490766","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Blind_Hands_0c41e50","source":"Blind: Стены, стены, двери, окна, а ОНО было рядом…","target":"Blind: Ziduri, ziduri, uși, ferestre, iar FĂPTURA era aproape…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-369.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
